{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44341","headline":"诗三百三首 三十八 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 三十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"余曾昔覩聪明士，博达英灵无比伦。\n一选嘉名喧宇宙，五言诗句越诸人。\n爲官治化超先辈，直爲无能继後尘。\n忍然富贵贪财色，瓦解冰消不可陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}